a) MOU dated 18.05.2006 (Ex.C1);
b) Claim statement filed by the respondent before the learned arbitrator, wherein, in paragraph No.7, he himself has pleaded that the last payment made by the respondent / claimant to the petitioner / respondent was on 02.09.2006;
