k) Order passed by this Court dated 01.08.2017 under Section 11 (6) of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996 in O.P.No.752 of 2016 by which the sole arbitrator (a former Judge of this Court) was appointed;
l) The impugned arbitral award dated 20.02.2019 passed by the sole arbitrator in favour of the respondent against the petitioner.
