In support of his submissions that Section 25 (3) of the Indian Contract Act does not get attracted for the instant case, learned counsel for the petitioner relied upon the following decisions:
a) In the case of Kotak Mahindra Bank Limited Vs. Kew Precision Parts Private Limited and Others reported in MANU/SC/0971/2022;
